    "final_answer": "I found excellent results. Let me provide my findings clearly.\n\nBased on my search on Booking.com for Mexico hotels with the dates December 25-26, 2026 (1 night, 2 adults), here are the top hotels with deals:\n\n## 🏨 Best Hotel with a Deal: **El Santuario Resort & Spa (埃尔桑图阿里奥度假Spa酒店)**\n\n- **Location:** Valle de Bravo, Mexico (巴耶德布拉沃)\n- **Original Price:** ~~US$311/night~~ (crossed out)\n- **Deal Price:** **US$218/night** (≈30% off — savings of ~US$93)\n- **Rating:** 8.5/10 \"Very Good\" (based on 790 reviews)\n- **Stars:** ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ (5-star)\n- **Room:** Standard King Bed (标准特大号床间)\n- **Amenities:** Spa, preferred partner badge, full resort amenities\n\n---\n\n### Other Notable Hotels Found:\n\n| # | Hotel | Location | Price/Night | Rating |\n|---|-------|----------|-------------|--------|\n| 1 | **Hotel Las Palmas Midway Inn** | Matehuala | US$62 | 8.6 (Only 2 rooms left at this price) |\n| 2 | **Hotel Ejecutivo Aeropuerto** | Álvaro Obregón (near Mexico City) | US$60 (incl. breakfast) | 8.8 (Location 9.3) |\n| 3 | **HOTEL MI HERMOSO DOLORES** | Dolores Hidalgo | US$51 (free cancellation) | 8.8 |\n| 4 | **Four Seasons Resort Punta Mita (彭塔米塔瑞吉度假酒店)** | Punta Mita | ~~US$2,515~~ → US$2,200 (5-star luxury) | 9.4 \"Excellent\" |\n| 5 | **蒙特雷空港贝斯特韦斯特酒店** | Apodaca, Monterrey | (5-star) | 9.1 \"Excellent\" |\n\n**Total available:** 17,293 properties in Mexico for Dec 25-26.\n\nThe clear standout deal is **El Santuario Resort & Spa in Valle de Bravo**, offering a 5-star experience at nearly 30% off the regular price for the December 25-26 stay.",
